# Leak sanitizer suppressions, used by test.cmake for builds with the address
# or the leak sanitizer. See https://clang.llvm.org/docs/LeakSanitizer.html
#
# OpenSSL builds its cache of fetched algorithm implementations on first use,
# and releases it only in OPENSSL_cleanup(), which does not run when the
# process exits without unloading libcrypto. All of these allocations pass
# through ossl_method_construct().
leak:ossl_method_construct
